# Dependency versions allowed in before they are 7 days old (WP-844).
#
# cmd/dep-age (CI's lint job, the pre-push hook) fails a change that adds a
# version published in the last 7 days to go.sum, a package-lock.json or a
# pin renovate.json tracks: a hijacked release is usually caught by others
# within days. A security fix that can't wait goes in here, one line per
# version, with the reason:
#
#   go golang.org/x/net v0.60.0 GO-2026-1234: request smuggling in http2, reachable from the API
#   npm dompurify 3.4.17 GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx: XSS in sanitize, used on every comment
#
# Once the version is 7 days old, dep-age says its line can go.
